  "problem": "Suppose $X$ and $Y$ are discrete random variables. Let the joint CDF of $X$ and $Y$ be $F(x,y),$ where the supports of $X$ and $Y$, respectively, are\n\n$$\n{S}_{X}=\\{-2,-1,0,1,2\\},\\,{S}_{Y}=\\{1,2,3\\}.\n$$\n\nFind an expression for the corresponding joint CDF when $x<2,y<1.$",
